    <span class="text-primary">💵</span>
    <span><strong>Subscribe now and get <span style="background:#A200F9;color:white">10% OFF</span></strong></span>
  </li>
  <li class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
    <span class="text-primary">🚛</span>
    <span>Get FREE shipping</span>
  </li>
  <li class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
    <span class="text-primary">🎙️</span>
    <span>LIVE monthly group webinar with our Nutritionist</span>
  </li>
  <li class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
    <span class="text-primary">🖥️</span>
    <span>Access to private Facebook group for extra support.</span>
  </li>
  <li class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
    <span class="text-primary">✋</span>
    <span>Pause or swap products anytime.</span>
  </li>
</ul>
